WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Cagrilintide
What tells the brain a meal is enough?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.600
When you eat, your pancreas releases amylin.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.200
Cagrilintide mimics this fullness signal and lasts longer.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.000
Read the cagrilintide guide at vetud.com.
